WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:02.179
(relaxing music)

00:00:02.179 --> 00:00:04.468
- [Voiceover] In the middle
of the harsh desert in Peru,

00:00:04.468 --> 00:00:07.309
surrounded by miles of rolling sand dunes,

00:00:07.309 --> 00:00:08.840
there's a small oasis

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:10.923
that's far from a mirage.

00:00:14.348 --> 00:00:18.520
The town of Huacachina has a
population of about 100 people

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:21.520
and is one of the few
remaining natural oases

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:23.770
in North and South America.

00:00:25.589 --> 00:00:27.757
It's a popular tourist destination,

00:00:27.757 --> 00:00:31.757
hosting tens of thousands
of tourists each year.

00:00:33.124 --> 00:00:35.479
In its heyday, the village flourished

00:00:35.479 --> 00:00:38.210
as an elite resort
getaway for the wealthy,

00:00:38.210 --> 00:00:40.629
who once flocked to the
waters of the lagoon

00:00:40.629 --> 00:00:44.138
because it was thought to
have medicinal properties.

00:00:44.138 --> 00:00:45.938
The resort became so popular,

00:00:45.938 --> 00:00:50.663
it is even featured on
Peru's official currency.

00:00:50.663 --> 00:00:52.866
Legend holds that the lagoon was created

00:00:52.866 --> 00:00:55.285
when a beautiful native
princess was apprehended

00:00:55.285 --> 00:00:57.346
at her bath by a young hunter.

00:00:57.346 --> 00:01:01.133
She fled, leaving the pool of
water she had been bathing in

00:01:01.133 --> 00:01:02.725
to become the lagoon.

00:01:02.725 --> 00:01:03.765
And the woman, herself,

00:01:03.765 --> 00:01:07.474
is rumored to still live
in the oasis as a mermaid.

00:01:07.474 --> 00:01:10.224
(relaxing music)

